# .vercelignore -- StatChat
#
# Vercel serves the project root statically, so every file committed to the
# repo is a URL. Verified live 3 Sep 2026: /GO_TO_MARKET.md returned pricing
# and competitive analysis, /TODO.md the open-bug list, /tests/contact_check.js
# its source. No credentials were exposed -- keys are only ever read from
# process.env -- but none of this is meant to be public, and robots.txt does
# not stop anyone reading a file, it only asks crawlers not to index it.
#
# This file also trims the deployment upload (tests/ 2.5 MB, tips/ excepted,
# sql/ 636 KB, root .md 664 KB), but the reason it exists is the serving.
#
# NOT ignored, deliberately:
#   tips/            served content -- tips.html loads 17 images from it
#   engine.js        loaded by 17 pages
#   billing.js releases.js team-icon.js   loaded by pages
#   api/             the functions; ignoring api/ would take the app down
#   package.json package-lock.json        the build reads them
#   vercel.json robots.txt sitemap.xml    routing and SEO
#
# Verify after deploying:
#   curl -sI https://www.statchat.co/tips/01-getting-started.jpg   -> 200
#   curl -sI https://www.statchat.co/TODO.md                       -> 404

